::U2UA_L3_Q01::Muscular strength emphasizes what? {=Force ~Duration only ~Reaction time ~Flexibility}

::U2UA_L3_Q02::Muscular endurance emphasizes what? {=Repeated or sustained effort ~One rapid response ~Joint range ~Body composition}

::U2UA_L3_Q03::Resistance is what? {=Opposition muscles work against ~A set of repetitions ~Resting pulse ~Movement speed}

::U2UA_L3_Q04::One completed movement is called what? {=A repetition ~A set ~Recovery ~Alignment}

::U2UA_L3_Q05::A group of repetitions is called what? {=A set ~A pulse ~A range ~A posture}


